// 4-semester.exam solved by QAOA instead: keep the two files' problems identical.
// Q16 (iv): six exams of a semester, three batches. Feasible.
problem semester_qaoa batches 3
students Ana Rui Eva Ivo Lia Tom
exam Algebra     weight 3 { Ana Rui }
exam Calculus    weight 3 { Rui Eva Tom }
exam Physics     weight 2 { Ana Eva }
exam Chemistry   weight 2 { Ivo Lia }
exam Programming weight 1 { Lia Tom }
exam Databases   weight 1 { Ivo Ana }

solver { method QAOA depth 2 optimizer COBYLA iterations 150 shots 4096 seed 7 }
